  "status": "RECORD, NOT A GATE. An explicit M_7-polarized model over the cooper_s7 coordinate, in the Clingher-Doran-Lewis-Whitcher normal form, with its W-invariants as exact Laurent polynomials in z. The rho = 20 cut stays read narrowly (T0 D7'); nothing is ranked or preferred; no Kodaira type is read here; no physical reading.",
